    "chunk_text": "ongean. \u00dea onbudon hie him \u00fe\u00e6t he come mid feawum monnum to Rome, & ealne his fultum be\u00e6ftan Ac \u00fea he hamweard for, him coman angean \u00fea III ealdormen \u00fee him on fultume w\u00e6ron, & him \u00dea wende eft Iulius to his agnum folce, & wepende m\u00e6nde \u00fea unare \u00fee him mon buton & he him si\u00fe\u00f0an aspon to \u00fea seofon legian \u00fee w\u00e6ron on Silomone \u00fe\u00e6m londe. \u00dea Pompeius & Cato & ealle \u00fea senatus \u00fe\u00e6t hierdon, \u00fea foran hi on Crecas, & micelne fultum \u00dea for Iulius to Rome, & abr\u00e6c hiera ma\u00f0mhus, & eall ged\u00e6lde his firde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6rinne w\u00e6s. \u00de\u00e6t is ungeliefedlic to gesecganne, cw\u00e6\u00f0 Orosius, hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6s ealles w\u00e6s. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for on Marisiam \u00fe\u00e6t lond, & \u00fe\u00e6r let \u00fereo legian be\u00e6ftan him, to \u00feon \u00fe\u00e6t hie \u00fe\u00e6t & he self mid \u00fe\u00e6m o\u00ferum d\u00e6le for on Ispanie, \u00fe\u00e6r Pompeiuses legian w\u00e6ron mid his \u00ferim & \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he for on Creca lond, \u00fe\u00e6r his Pompeius on anre dune onbad mid XXXgum \u00dea for Pompeius \u00fe\u00e6r Marcellus w\u00e6s, Iuliuses ladteow, & hiene ofslog mid eallum his folce. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m Iulius bes\u00e6t Tarquatus, Pompeius ladteow, on anum f\u00e6stenne. & him Pompeius \u00e6fter for. \u00de\u00e6r wear\u00f0 Iulius gefliemed, & his folces fela forslagen, for \u00feon \u00fee him mon feaht on on twa Si\u00fe\u00fean for Iulius on Thesaliam, & \u00fe\u00e6r eft his f",
